{"step_index":129,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T02:40:02Z","thinking":"**Defining User's Intent**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the user's need for granular detail. The initial prompt, \"구체적으로,\" necessitates a comprehensive list. I'm focusing on dissecting the request's core demand to deliver fully specified information.\n\n\n**Generating Detailed Data**\n\nI've determined the specific data extraction requirements. I'm focusing on providing exhaustive lists for problematic rows, including exact line numbers, company details, and actionable guides for each case. I'm preparing a Node.js script to create Excel and HTML files with detailed, transparent data for all identified issues.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Generate full specific problem report spreadsheet and data","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst ExcelJS = require('c:/Users/lg/resilient-bardeen/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nfunction parseCSVLine(text) {\n  const result = [];\n  let cur = '';\n  let inQuotes = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {\n    const char = text[i];\n    if (char === '\"') {\n      if (inQuotes && text[i + 1] === '\"') {\n        cur += '\"';\n        i++;\n      } else {\n        inQuotes = !inQuotes;\n      }\n    } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\n      result.push(cur);\n      cur = '';\n    } else {\n      cur += char;\n    }\n  }\n  result.push(cur);\n  return result;\n}\n\nconst filePath = 'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.csv';\nconst content = fs.readFileSync(filePath, 'utf8');\nconst lines = content.split(/\\r?\\n/);\n\nconst bhmRows = [];\nlet seq = 0;\nfor (let i = 1; i < lines.length; i++) {\n  if (!lines[i].trim()) continue;\n  const cols = parseCSVLine(lines[i]);\n  if (cols[0] === '배현명') {\n    seq++;\n    bhmRows.push({ seq, lineNum: i + 1, cols });\n  }\n}\n\n